      STR_OP_RADAR_STATION: Radar station
      STR_OP_CAMO_NET: Camouflage netting
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_FORWARD_CAMP: Raid on the forward camp
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_PORT: Raid on the port
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_AIRSTRIP: Raid on the airstrip
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_LISTENING_POST: Raid on the listening post
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_TTBP: Raid on the tactical battle platform
      STR_OUTPOST_OK: can build
      STR_OUTPOST_PICK_KIND: Pick what to build here
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_RESEARCH: Not researched yet
      STR_OUTPOST_CAP_REACHED: No more outposts allowed (Forward Operations research raises the limit)
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_OPEN_WATER: Needs open water, away from land
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_LAND: Needs land
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_COAST: Needs the coast or a river bank
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_GOODWILL: That country won't allow it (goodwill too low)
      STR_OUTPOST_NEEDS_COUNTRY: No country here to give permission
      STR_OUTPOST_NOT_HERE: That can't be built at this base
      STR_OUTPOST_PADS_ONLY: At an outpost, add-ons go only on the build pads
      STR_OUTPOST_FIXED_BUILDING: This outpost came with that building; it can't be taken down
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_TITLE: OUTPOST UNDER ATTACK
      STR_OUTPOST_RAID_BRIEFING: Cobra is hitting the outpost. Hold it.
  - type: en-GB
    strings: *opstr
